OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fcloudy with further outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Fbut some drier spells too.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain spreading north through the
OL,13,Fday, perhaps turning heavy at times in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,17,FUnsettled on Wednesday with showers or
OL,18,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,19,FRain clears Thursday morning, then
OL,20,Fdrier and brighter with a few showers.
OL,21,FBright start Friday, showers later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
